36
00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:48.280
Its significance is proof of concept: an
entirely different

37
00:01:48.280 --> 00:01:51.360
physical foundation for computing can
actually work at scale,

38
00:01:51.520 --> 00:01:54.160
with real yield, using processes that
could one day

39
00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:58.960
be industrialized. The Bottom Line The
silicon era is

40
00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:01.180
